~ no_rod
Traveller: [[There are fish down there. Nothing in my hands to get them with.|Plenty of fish. No line, no hook, no hope.|Fish, yes. Something to catch them with, no.]]
=> END

~ glint
Traveller: Something down there is catching the light. Not a fish. Fish don't hold still.
Traveller: [[That's a key, or I've never seen one.|A key. Down there, in the weed.|Somebody's key, on the bottom of a forest pond.]] Too deep to reach, but I have a rod.
=> END

~ prize
Traveller: That is not a fish. A key — iron, and a long time in the water.
Traveller: [[Somebody dropped this. Or somebody hid it.|Nobody loses a key in the middle of a pond by accident.|Whatever this opens, it wasn't meant to be opened.]]
=> END

~ prize_missed
Traveller: [[Weed. The hook comes up wearing half the pond.|Nothing. It's still down there.|Missed it. It's not going anywhere — try again.]]
=> END
